<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Privacy' }) %>
<div class="card" style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto">
  <h1>Privacy statement</h1>
  <p>Ridgeline Facilities collects the personal information needed to provide maintenance services: account contacts, site access details, site contact names and numbers, job photographs, and (for contractors) business, compliance and bank details. We handle it in line with the Privacy Act 2020.</p>
  <h3>How we use it</h3>
  <p>To book, dispatch and verify maintenance work, invoice and receive payments, pay contractors, meet our tax and health &amp; safety obligations, and contact you about your account.</p>
  <h3>Who sees it</h3>
  <p>Contractors see the job, site address, access instructions and site contact only for jobs offered or assigned to them. Customers never see contractor bank details or another customer's records. Our accounting, payment and email providers process data on our behalf.</p>
  <h3>Location data</h3>
  <p>When a contractor records arrival or completion, their device may share its location if they permit it. Location is recorded only at those moments.</p>
  <h3>Your rights</h3>
  <p>You can ask to access or correct your personal information by emailing our privacy officer. Financial records are retained as required by tax law (generally seven years).</p>
  <p class="muted">Ridgeline should review this statement with its legal adviser before go-live.</p>
</div>
